# CodeGraph is available in this workspace

A `.codegraph/` SQLite knowledge graph is maintained by the CodeGraph MCP
server (see [xops/codegraph/README.md](../../xops/codegraph/README.md)).

**Prefer CodeGraph tools over file scanning** when you need to:
- find a symbol definition, callers, callees, or impact radius
- map an area of the codebase before editing
- locate a route/handler binding

Fall back to `grep` / `find` / `Read` only when CodeGraph returns nothing.

After any of the following, run `make codegraph.reindex` (or call
`codegraph init -i`) before relying on graph queries:
- a `git rebase` that moved many files
- a refactor that renamed/moved >10 symbols
- a merge from `main` that touched the native engine

The repo rulebook is [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) (cross-cutting) +
[.github/copilot-instructions.md](../../.github/copilot-instructions.md)
(engine/mod rules). CodeGraph never overrides the per-mod allow-list or the
commit gate model — it is a discovery tool, not a license to touch shared code.
